      "value": "@{5f32a3e9c3d5be457144dcc7|full_name}Hmm... So, there are both people who feel it's convenient and inconvenient.\n\nIf I take one or the other, I think it should be reset (to prevent accidents. In fact, it is far more likely to accidentally send an invite/reqin with a message attached).\n\nThe best thing would be an option to toggle with/without resetting.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
